16. Spread क्या है और Pip से कैसे Related है?
Spread = Broker का hidden charge
Basic Structure
Bid Price  =  Broker आपसे खरीदता है
Ask Price  =  Broker आपको बेचता है

Spread  =  Ask - Bid
Example — EURUSD
Bid  =  1.10500
Ask  =  1.10503
──────────────────
Spread  =  0.00003
         =  0.3 pips
         =  3 pipettes
Example — Gold
Bid  =  1999.80
Ask  =  2000.20
──────────────────
Spread  =  0.40
         =  40 pips
Spread का Real Impact
Gold Buy trade:
  आप Enter करते हो   →  2000.20 (Ask)
  Market अभी है      →  1999.80 (Bid)
  
  आप तुरंत 40 pips BEHIND हो
  Trade खोलते ही loss में हो

  यानी सिर्फ Spread recover करने के लिए
  Gold को 40 pips ऊपर जाना होगा
Spread affect करता है Target को
Target    =  100 pips profit
Spread    =  40 pips cost
─────────────────────────────
Actually चाहिए  →  140 pips का market move

तभी net profit = 100 pips होगा
17. Pip Risk Management — Risk Per Trade
Professional Rule
Maximum Risk Per Trade  =  Account का 1-2%

$1,000 account:
  1% risk  =  $10 per trade
  2% risk  =  $20 per trade
Lot Size Calculation from Risk
Formula:
Lot Size  =  Risk Amount  ÷  (SL Pips × Pip Value)

Example:
  Risk Amount  =  $10
  Stop Loss    =  50 pips
  Pip Value    =  $0.10 (0.01 lot Gold)

  Lot Size  =  $10 ÷ (50 × $0.10)
             =  $10 ÷ $5
             =  2 micro lots (0.02)
